  # Continuum: ...->roda->mreb->mrec->mred->rodz->pbp2->pbp1a->lpoa->meps->mepm->meph->slt->ampg->nagz->ampd
  #   (AmpG IM anhydro-muropeptide permease -> NagZ cytoplasmic GlcNAc hydrolase).
  # Pay take=min(n,atp,energy) - ATP stand-in for NagZ glycosidase cleavage cycle.
