  # AnmK: cytoplasmic anhMurNAc kinase after AmpD amidase cleavage.
  # AnmK phosphorylates 1,6-anhydro-MurNAc freed by AmpD, opening the anhydro ring
  # to MurNAc-6-P so MurQ etherase can yield GlcNAc-6-P for glycolysis/PG reuse.
  # Without AnmK after AmpD, free anhMurNAc stalls and the recycle branch cannot
  # feed sugar-phosphate pools back into central metabolism.
  # Domain: post-AmpD AnmK anhydro-N-acetylmuramic acid kinase (not AmpD amidase,
